content Schemas and captured named services; MCP owns only the search-result envelope around the canonical content result Schema. Toolkit stays private. No independent engine, saved personal report or public package export.\",\n    \"allowance\": \"One checked calculator request identity, calculation pool, work budget and rate service shared with HTTP/RPC; first caller capabilities excluded from toolkit construction\",\n    \"cancellation\": \"Original native Request.signal supplied as private Context.Reference<Option<AbortSignal>>; synchronous native Effect callback registers then checks again and owns cleanup\",\n    \"response\": \"Complete reply bytes bounded to 2 MiB and total handler/body read to ten seconds; no subscriptions or resumption advertised\",\n    \"privacy\": \"Fixed declared failure vocabulary and existing safe error reporter; no raw causes, figures or rate identities in replies/logs\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"effect\": \"4.0.0\",\n    \"alchemy\": \"2.0.0-beta.80\",\n    \"officialClient\": \"2.3.1 test-only in API/Web\",\n    \"clientTarballSha256\": \"0febe399e355b703d4e9fa6eb1453c5fa06b06c78e2421d797dcb145fb9bb68f\",\n    \"effectTarballSha256\": \"eff6ca16140c491380cfdb4bcbc51be6a51f1ac2d402ebc8420e76ccf3e0e19a\",\n    \"referenceEffect\": \"rc.112 at 2600f62f4532026928454dcea8d1c48557b3f942, guidance only\",\n    \"referenceAlchemy\": \"beta.75 at 808ef694b2e742a2bb76cb301da371e71421fa57, guidance only\",\n    \"compatibility\": \"Installed APIs own compatibility; no existing dependency upgrade. Test type conditions choose compiled EventSource export identical to standard import, avoiding its unrelated raw source under workspace source conditions.\",\n    \"existingPackageVersionAccounting\": \"HEAD-to-candidate resolved package/version multiset loses no existing entry; six new test-client packages only. path-key 3.1.1 and 4.0.0 are relocated without a consumer version change.\"\n  },\n  \"focusedChecks\": [\n    {\n      \"stage\": \