{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T01:53:01.702Z","ordinal":58587,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5a5d23b4487d0896d0c53d3b1cf9b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4d7df488c774401a8ab5980efe2715e8","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json,hashlib\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nreceipt_path=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json')\\nrows=[]\\nfor prefix in ['dev77-browser-restore-a','dev77-browser-native-l']:\\n for line in Path(f'/private/tmp/{prefix}-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines():\\n  r=json.loads(line);p=Path(r.pop('log'));r['logId']=p.name;r['logSha256']=hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest();rows.append(r)\\nx={\\n 'document_type':'proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-implementation-owner','last_reviewed':'2026-10-07','review_trigger':'Browser tool contracts, page state, native host/caller, scope, receiving APIs or qualification change',\\n 'outcome':'Focused actual native caller and saved-form browser checks passed; complete local graph is pending; T006 remains in progress',\\n 'executionAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','scope':'Approved DEV-77 local implementation/checks, tested commit/push/draft PR and routine Linear tracking','excluded':['merge','deployment','publication','provider apply','credential changes','memory changes'],'metrics':'Deferred; collection remains disabled'},\\n 'candidate':{'repository':'crcorbett/taxkit','branch':'codex/dev-77-browser-tools','baseCommit':'4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e','phase':'Focused caller proof; candidate freeze and full graph pending','sources':[]},\\n 'versions':{'effect':'4.0.0','alchemy':'2.0.0-beta.80','webmcpTypes':'0.1.10 type-only','webmcpTypesTarballSha256':'cf3352075f4ff3e407c26dc3e6317914ae1dac55bdafb5302ddf142650456be6','playwright':'1.63.0','chromium':'153.0.8010.12 with WebMCP enabled in a disposable browser','node':'24.16.0','bun':'1.4.2','referenceEffect':'rc.112 at 2600f62f4532026928454dcea8d1c48557b3f942; guidance only','referenceAlchemy':'beta.75 at 808ef694b2e742a2bb76cb301da371e71421fa57; guidance only','dependencyAccounting':'Lockfile diff adds only webmcp-types 0.1.10; no existing resolved package changes'},\\n 'ownership':{'contracts':'Five private concrete native Toolkit tools; canonical catalogue/form/report contracts and one shared WebsiteCalculatorViewState','runtime':'Existing React calculatorRuntime.fn; explicit register/Atom.Interrupt page lifecycle; one registration-scoped FiberSet callback bridge','commands':'Current form edit/submit commands and existing checked RPC calculation; no duplicate backend client or engine','attempt':'Checked request object identity survives idle registration, gates reply ownership and limits cleanup to its unfinished work','subscriptions':'AtomRegistry.getResult and invocation-scoped AtomRegistry.toStream; no per-call subscribers retained for whole registration','host':'Lazy capability and exact checked origin; original native receiver; independently abortable two-second registration; twelve-second outer execution limit','codec':'Unknown decoded once to native Tool.EmptyParams; checked Schema.toType advertises empty-record metadata; Toolkit owns JSON results, exact host owns fixed failure egress','privacy':'No saved figures, automatic retries, extra calculation on read/mount or raw host/cause/input diagnostics'},\\n 'focusedChecks':rows,\\n 'observedPostconditions':['Actual Chrome native developer-tools caller discovers five tools without calculation','Catalogue read, visible default take-home calculation/read and annual fill/calculation/read use existing RPC','Annual 75000-dollar form returns retained 14788-dollar answer, equal to completed manual calculation','Excess no-argument fields reject with fixed invalid-input and no extra request','Edit retains stale answer; overlapping call is busy','Native caller abort and form edit interrupt unfinished calls; subsequent manual retry succeeds','Navigating to another calculator removes old five and registers new five; leaving calculators removes all five and interrupts unfinished execution','Different restored pay form agrees with displayed fields, shared page view and next explicit checked request'],\\n 'receivingQualifications':['Empty Struct silently accepted excess fields in Effect 4.0.0; native EmptyParams ingress is required','FnContext installed types have no once/resultOnce methods; use typed registry operations','Deferred registry garbage collection allowed cross-page tool name collisions; explicit named register/Interrupt removes old tools on page cleanup','Unretained attempt atom lost identity between callbacks; hold it for registration lifetime','Seeding the home writable projection displayed restored fields without updating owning form; seed owning atoms.form and prove distinct restored amount/period/threshold','Chrome153 document caller shape differs from newer type-only declarations; actual proof uses installed developer-tools native caller types','Chrome153 removal alone does not stop native execution; invocation/page scopes must interrupt the owned callback'],\\n 'documentationImpact':{'changeRequired':['Website guide','frontend and testing architecture','exact tooling admissions and real CLI fixtures','current critical journey','active plan','dated proof/index'],'preserve':['retained tax rules and results','existing anonymous allowance and RPC','ordinary browser and HTML forms','accepted public content and navigation','native remote checkpoint and original recovery records','disabled metrics'],'notApplicable':['New Changeset: private app/type-only dependency only; no public package contract or export changes','New operational procedure: existing native-pair and release commands unchanged','Canonical skill assets and root instructions unchanged']},\\n 'qualification':{'state':'pending complete frozen local nine-check graph'},\\n 'limitations':['Native protocol caller is controlled by Playwright; no autonomous model agent session','Experimental feature enabled only in disposable test browser; no general browser support claim','Older remote adapter sessions, actual remote network cancellation and public setup remain unfinished','No deployment, public availability, provider state, merge or publication proof'],\\n 'rollback':'Restore this slice to base commit 4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e; local only, no provider rollback needed',\\n 'remaining':['Complete current-source checks and primary review','Commit/push/read back reviewable draft stacked on #156','Finish older MCP sessions, real remote cancellation and qualified public setup before T006 acceptance']\\n}\\nreceipt_path.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/verification/critical-journeys.json');j=json.loads(p.read_text())\\nfor entry in j['journeys']:\\n if entry['id']=='taxkit-native-website':\\n  entry['boundary'] += ' and page-owned visible browser tools'\\n  entry['inputs'].append('Chrome153 native WebMCP caller with experimental feature enabled in a disposable context')\\n  entry['expectedBehavior'].append('Five mounted browser tools use the visible commands and shared state: no calculation on mount/read; actual fill/calculate/read equals a completed manual RPC; excess fields reject; editing keeps a stale answer; busy calls reject; caller/edit/page cancellation stops unfinished callbacks and manual retry still succeeds.')\\n  entry['oracle'] += ' Chrome153 actual native developer-tools events and invoke/cancel commands require real registration and native replies rather than a copied host object. A manual response witness must complete before answer equality. Pending real RPC is held at browser transport to prove busy admission, native caller abort, edit cancellation, successful manual retry and removal of five tools on route exit. Restored non-default pay fields, shared view and next checked request must agree. This is a test-controlled native caller, not an autonomous model session.'\\n  entry['evidence'].append(str(receipt_path))\\np.write_text(json.dumps(j,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md')\\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\n\\n## 2026-10-07 — T006 visible browser caller qualification\\n\\nHosted Quality run `37554420197` completed successfully for exact remote-tool\\ncommit `4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e` in draft #156. This readback\\nqualifies that earlier head, not the current browser source or deployment.\\n\\nThe browser candidate now uses one shared page form/report/error state and the\\nexisting visible edit/submit commands. Native Toolkit owns five commands and\\nJSON output. One concrete host boundary preserves the original receiver,\\nchecks exact origin/capability and uses a registration-scoped FiberSet callback\\nbridge. Native registration is explicitly started/interrupted by the container;\\ndeferred registry cleanup was too late when two pages used the same tool names.\\nA retained checked request identity and per-invocation subscription prevent old\\ncalls returning a newer answer or cancelling newer unfinished work.\\n\\nActual Chrome153 native developer-tools invocation passed catalogue/form reads,\\ndefault take-home calculation, annual fill/calculate/read, equality after a real\\nmanual RPC response, excess-input rejection without another request, stale\\nanswer retention, busy rejection, caller abort, edit interruption, successful\\nmanual retry and route removal/cancellation. Controlled host checks separately\\ncover absence, unsupported/wrong origin, receiver preservation, independent\\nrefusal, stalled registration and safe failures. This proves actual native\\nprotocol calls controlled by the test, not an autonomous model session.\\n\\nReceiving Effect 4.0.0 accepts excess keys for an empty Struct. Native\\n`Tool.EmptyParams` now owns one unknown ingress decode and checked host metadata.\\nThe installed FnContext has no typed once/resultOnce operations; native registry\\noperations own reads and fresh result waits. A writable form projection must\\nnot receive saved initial values directly: its underlying form can stay at the\\ndefault. The home container seeds the owning page form. Hydration now proves a\\ndifferent amount, period and threshold agrees with visible fields/shared state\\nand the next explicit request. These findings are promoted into current owner\\nand direct tests rather than treated as passed protocol or UI proof.\\n\\nThe dated browser receipt records sources, actual checks and proof limits.\\nDocumentation impact is **Change required** for Website/frontend/test/tooling\\nowners, current journey, active intent and proof/index; **Preserve** for ordinary\\nmanual/HTML behaviour, retained tax rules/results, existing allowance/RPC,\\naccepted public content, canonical skills, original recovery history and disabled\\ncollection. **N/A** for a Changeset: private app plus type-only dependency, no\\npublic package contract change. The existing native-pair and release operations\\nremain the owners. Complete frozen qualification, primary review and tested\\ncommit/push/draft delivery remain next. Older remote sessions, actual remote\\ncancellation and public setup still prevent whole T006 acceptance.\\n''')\\nprint(json.dumps({'receipt':str(receipt_path),'focusedChecks':len(rows),'journey':'taxkit-native-website'}))\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:67448,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791337938.234769}}}
