 it.\\nRecord implementation, review, CI, deployment and release evidence separately. If\\npublication is part of acceptance, keep the delivery issue open until the\\nrelease is verified, even when the implementation PR has merged.\\n\\nBefore finishing, reconcile the accepted main and child issues, native related\\nlinks and remaining blockers. Read back changed fields and saved comments or\\nupdates. Return the useful issue/project links and any work still outstanding.\\n\\n## Sources\\n\\nReviewed on 3 October 2026 against the connected Personal workspace and current\\nLinear tool schemas. Product behaviour is documented in\\n[issue relations](https://linear.app/docs/issue-relations),\\n[issue status](https://linear.app/docs/configuring-workflows),\\n[project updates](https://linear.app/docs/initiative-and-project-updates) and\\n[GitHub integration](https://linear.app/docs/github).\\n{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://taxkit.local/schemas/product-spec-task-plan.v1.json\\\",\\n  \\\"spec\\\": \\\"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Clean slate TaxKit foundation — implementation slices\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"in_progress\\\",\\n  \\\"last_reviewed\\\": \\\"2026-10-07\\\",\\n  \\\"authority\\\": \\\"Cooper explicitly authorised implementation, reviewable commits and draft PRs on 2026-10-04. No merge, deploy or publication; provider-plan approval remains separate.\\\",\\n  \\\"principles\\\": [\\n    \\\"Retain tax rules/results and their proof while replacing application foundations.\\\",\\n    \\\"Use immutable Schema-derived values and declarative, pipe-first Effect workflows across all owned apps/packages/tests/scripts/infrastructure; no local mutation, imperative loops or helper sprawl. Necessary state has a scoped React/Effect owner and pure updates.\\\",\\n    \\\"One primary owner integrates and accepts whole slices; agent or test counts do not establish proof.\\\",\\n    \\\"Every required owning document, README, rule, export, generated source, skill and runbook changes within the affected slice.\\\",\\n    \\\"Use current qualified exact dependencies; no silent downgrade, broad exception or unproved peer override.\\\",\\n    \\\"Each task is pending until its actual postconditions and applicable checks pass. Proposed tasks do not authorise cloud changes.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"globalVerification\\\": {\\n    \\\"commitPolicy\\\": \\\"Commit coherent passed slices and prepare draft PRs under the 2026-10-04 implementation request. Do not merge, version-release, publish or deploy.\\\",\\n    \\\"requiredBeforeFinalPR\\\": [\\n      \\\"bun run verification\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run test\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run build\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run sdk:check-packed-artifact\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run sdk:validate-downstream\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run release:check\\\",\\n      \\\"bun run changeset:status\\\",\\n      \\\"git diff --check\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"evidenceRequired\\\": [\\n      \\\"Final current/target/test call graph and exact candidate/version/configuration identity.\\\",\\n      \\\"Actual-command rejection/acceptance fixtures for the complete 0.6.0 portable Effect baseline and evidenced gap corrections under every owned path group; readonly type proof, exact exception inventory and structural call-graph review remain distinct.\\\",\\n      \\\"Path-evidenced documentation, README, lint, skill, export, generated, CI and operational impact decisions.\\\",\\n      \\\"Changeset and fixed release-train impact, or an evidenced no-Changeset rationale.\\\",\\n      \\\"Bounded receipts: repository/cwd, command/procedure owner, expected/observed postcondition, authority, outcome, limitations, recovery and explicit non-claims.\\\",\\n      \\\"Local, Preview, provider indexing, DNS/TLS, Production and publication are separate proof boundaries.\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"downstreamArtifactImpact\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"surface\\\": \\\"Domain and public package contracts\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"Change required\\\",\\n      \\\"paths\\\": [\\n        \\\"packages/core/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/calculators/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/rules/au/*/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/api/http/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/api/rpc/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/sdk/typescript/**\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"tasks\\\": [\\n        \\\"CSF-T002\\\",\\n        \\\"CSF-T003\\\",\\n        \\\"CSF-T004\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"surface\\\": \\\"App lifetimes and frontend/agents/content\\\",\\n      \\\"decision\\\": \\\"Change required\\\",\\n      \\\"paths\\\": [\\n        \\\"apps/api/**\\\",\\n        \\\"apps/web/**\\\",\\n        \\\"apps/docs/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/docs-content/**\\\",\\n        \\\"packages/docs-fumadocs/**\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"tasks\\\": [\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791339884.470819}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
