{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:02.950Z","ordinal":59415,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5adb8253c87d0baec5033358e5193","status":"completed","call_id":"call_17b029c6ca0c4bcbb5d9a39a137109dc","name":"exec","input":"const r = await Promise.allSettled([\ntools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_get_issue({id:\"DEV-77\",includeRelations:true}),\ntools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_list_comments({issueId:\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\",limit:100}),\ntools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh pr list --repo crcorbett/taxkit --head codex/dev-77-browser-tools --state all --json number,title,state,isDraft,url,headRefName,baseRefName; rg -n 'FAIL|stdout=|stderr=|RUN ' /private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-release-a-release-graph.log | head -10\",\"max_output_tokens\":1000})\n]);for(let i=0;i<r.length;i++)text({i,result:r[i]});\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791339960.5881183}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:02.974Z","ordinal":59416,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","session_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","root_turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","response_id":"resp_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5adb64e2c87d0a5357b37b7832fe1","usage":{"input_tokens":175182,"cached_input_tokens":174720,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":187,"reasoning_output_tokens":0,"total_tokens":175369},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":284644756,"cached_input_tokens":279261184,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1524268,"reasoning_output_tokens":768162,"total_tokens":286169024},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1120031295,"cached_input_tokens":1097099648,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5467248,"reasoning_output_tokens":2447206,"total_tokens":1125498543}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:03.554Z","ordinal":59417,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-42e1dd67-378f-496a-a43d-8b39cfb3157c","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-77","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"uuid\":\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T006` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nAgents need checked ways to discover docs and calculators, run calculations and read answers without a second implementation.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Expose catalogue/docs discovery, checked calculator input, calculation and result operations through native Effect remote MCP and the same application services.\\n* Qualify the selected stateless and stateful protocol adapters, anonymous limits, allowed origins, bounded sessions/streams, cancellation and safe errors.\\n* Feature-detect browser WebMCP. Let tools find/read/fill/calculate/read results through visible page commands and the checked RPC client.\\n* Cancel and unregister browser tools when the page changes or closes. Keep normal browser use working when the browser has no WebMCP support.\\n* Publish accurate setup/discovery docs and record actual browser support.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Tool names, input Schemas and descriptions match the current content/calculator catalogue.\\n* A real remote client and supported browser agent complete the intended journeys. Registration alone is not a passed agent check.\\n* All calls use bounded anonymous access and the shared calculation/event owner; no account or saved figures are required.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation is now in progress under Cooper’s approved continuation plan, on `codex/dev-77-native-agent-tools`, stacked on documentation commit [366b3e14](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/366b3e1464a356ef12d08fef34ee3c1525566910>) in <pull-request id=\\\"7022754f-bddd-4f5b-8197-0cffa0876b98\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-76-replace-documentation-reader-and-retire-the-old-app-f57918ee6f81\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#155</pull-request>. Initial qualification checks the installed native Effect adapters against the official MCP client and current browser guidance. Older-session routing/expiry, calculation/content integration and a real browser caller remain unproved. Metrics remain deferred; no merge, deployment, publication or provider apply is authorised by this work.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L490>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-77-csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:57.912Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T00:54:48.336Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.084Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"mcp\",\"api\",\"web\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"04318905-7119-4005-8554-03d4bfdb8219\",\"title\":\"[DEV-77] Add remote calculator and documentation tools\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/156\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:13:57.912Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.097Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.097Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"assignee\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"assigneeId\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-80\",\"title\":\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":591999750}},"started_at_ms":1791339962961,"completed_at_ms":1791339963554}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:03.669Z","ordinal":59418,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1e475eae-36b8-4cb2-b876-4bcd8ce70be4","process_id":"67037","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr list --repo crcorbett/taxkit --head codex/dev-77-browser-tools --state all --json number,title,state,isDraft,url,headRefName,baseRefName; rg -n 'FAIL|stdout=|stderr=|RUN ' /private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-release-a-release-graph.log | head -10"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr list --repo crcorbett/taxkit --head codex/dev-77-browser-tools --state all --json number,title,state,isDraft,url,headRefName,baseRefName; rg -n 'FAIL|stdout=|stderr=|RUN ' /private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-release-a-release-graph.log | head -10"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"[]\n2:@taxkit/scripts release:check: RUN  [verification] bun run verification\n4:@taxkit/scripts release:check: FAIL [verification] non-zero-exit\n17:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts > built native API and Website > uses the real API through the binding and browser, including an idle form and no JavaScript\n38:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-rpc-failures.boundary.test.ts > contains native global, procedure and fatal RPC replies in real Workers\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"[]\n2:@taxkit/scripts release:check: RUN  [verification] bun run verification\n4:@taxkit/scripts release:check: FAIL [verification] non-zero-exit\n17:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts > built native API and Website > uses the real API through the binding and browser, including an idle form and no JavaScript\n38:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-rpc-failures.boundary.test.ts > contains native global, procedure and fatal RPC replies in real Workers\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":556663166},"formatted_output":"[]\n2:@taxkit/scripts release:check: RUN  [verification] bun run verification\n4:@taxkit/scripts release:check: FAIL [verification] non-zero-exit\n17:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts > built native API and Website > uses the real API through the binding and browser, including an idle form and no JavaScript\n38:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-rpc-failures.boundary.test.ts > contains native global, procedure and fatal RPC replies in real Workers\n"},"started_at_ms":1791339963112,"completed_at_ms":1791339963669}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:04.394Z","ordinal":59419,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-f0ea1462-bb3a-415e-a6d6-7fbae9449cdc","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.list_comments","arguments":{"issueId":"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e","limit":100},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"list_comments","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"53a730de-dcfc-4721-8032-e86546a4aa07\",\"body\":\"The modern remote-tool checkpoint is pushed as draft [#156](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/156), stacked on draft #155. Exact head: [4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e).\\n\\nThe API now offers six tools at `/mcp` for calculator discovery/input definitions/calculation and accepted documentation navigation/search/read. They use the existing services and shared calculation allowance. Only protocol `2026-07-28` is composed.\\n\\nAll nine ordered local release checks passed in 896.89 seconds, including complete repository verification, tests/builds, packaged SDK/downstream use, API smoke testing and both full built-app runs (12 tests across eight files). The official client also checks all six tools, refused headers/versions/origins, separate callers, safe failures and cancellation with the real eight-call pool full. A real network client matches HTTP report/page values and uses the same allowance.\\n\\nThe [dated evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-mcp.json) retains the failed first graph and its corrected unused export, 28 frozen source identities, 18 exact check files/hashes and primary review. GitHub Quality run [37554420197](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37554420197) is still running; local checks do not establish hosted success.\\n\\nDEV-77 stays In Progress. Older Worker session routing/expiry, real network cancellation, visible browser tools and public setup instructions remain unfinished. Next work is the browser's visible page commands and their cleanup; private actual-browser probes are preparation only. Retained tax results stay unchanged. Metrics remain deferred. No merge, deployment, publication or provider apply.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T00:55:18.116Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T00:55:18.078Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":432283541}},"started_at_ms":1791339962962,"completed_at_ms":1791339964394}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:26:04.455Z","ordinal":59420,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1142e-a827-79c2-92a0-16a9c03f4ff1","call_id":"call_17b029c6ca0c4bcbb5d9a39a137109dc","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T006` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nAgents need checked ways to discover docs and calculators, run calculations and read answers without a second implementation.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Expose catalogue/docs discovery, checked calculator input, calculation and result operations through native Effect remote MCP and the same application services.\\\\n* Qualify the selected stateless and stateful protocol adapters, anonymous limits, allowed origins, bounded sessions/streams, cancellation and safe errors.\\\\n* Feature-detect browser WebMCP. Let tools find/read/fill/calculate/read results through visible page commands and the checked RPC client.\\\\n* Cancel and unregister browser tools when the page changes or closes. Keep normal browser use working when the browser has no WebMCP support.\\\\n* Publish accurate setup/discovery docs and record actual browser support.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Tool names, input Schemas and descriptions match the current content/calculator catalogue.\\\\n* A real remote client and supported browser agent complete the intended journeys. Registration alone is not a passed agent check.\\\\n* All calls use bounded anonymous access and the shared calculation/event owner; no account or saved figures are required.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nImplementation is now in progress under Cooper’s approved continuation plan, on `codex/dev-77-native-agent-tools`, stacked on documentation commit [366b3e14](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/366b3e1464a356ef12d08fef34ee3c1525566910>) in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"7022754f-bddd-4f5b-8197-0cffa0876b98\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-76-replace-documentation-reader-and-retire-the-old-app-f57918ee6f81\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#155</pull-request>. Initial qualification checks the installed native Effect adapters against the official MCP client and current browser guidance. Older-session routing/expiry, calculation/content integration and a real browser caller remain unproved. Metrics remain deferred; no merge, deployment, publication or provider apply is authorised by this work.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L490>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-77-csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:57.912Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T00:54:48.336Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.084Z\\\",\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"mcp\\\",\\\"api\\\",\\\"web\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"04318905-7119-4005-8554-03d4bfdb8219\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"[DEV-77] Add remote calculator and documentation tools\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/156\\\"}],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:13:57.912Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.097Z\\\"},{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-06T23:38:42.097Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"assigneeId\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-80\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T009 — Send safe logs, traces and metrics to the three shared Axiom datasets\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"53a730de-dcfc-4721-8032-e86546a4aa07\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"The modern remote-tool checkpoint is pushed as draft [#156](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/156), stacked on draft #155. Exact head: [4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e).\\\\n\\\\nThe API now offers six tools at `/mcp` for calculator discovery/input definitions/calculation and accepted documentation navigation/search/read. They use the existing services and shared calculation allowance. Only protocol `2026-07-28` is composed.\\\\n\\\\nAll nine ordered local release checks passed in 896.89 seconds, including complete repository verification, tests/builds, packaged SDK/downstream use, API smoke testing and both full built-app runs (12 tests across eight files). The official client also checks all six tools, refused headers/versions/origins, separate callers, safe failures and cancellation with the real eight-call pool full. A real network client matches HTTP report/page values and uses the same allowance.\\\\n\\\\nThe [dated evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/4b349e0d1605687d0c5670af3edcd4ffdb82481e/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-mcp.json) retains the failed first graph and its corrected unused export, 28 frozen source identities, 18 exact check files/hashes and primary review. GitHub Quality run [37554420197](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37554420197) is still running; local checks do not establish hosted success.\\\\n\\\\nDEV-77 stays In Progress. Older Worker session routing/expiry, real network cancellation, visible browser tools and public setup instructions remain unfinished. Next work is the browser's visible page commands and their cleanup; private actual-browser probes are preparation only. Retained tax results stay unchanged. Metrics remain deferred. No merge, deployment, publication or provider apply.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T00:55:18.116Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T00:55:18.078Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}],\\\"hasNextPage\\\":false}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"99ef23\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.556793208,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":137,\"output\":\"[]\\n2:@taxkit/scripts release:check: RUN  [verification] bun run verification\\n4:@taxkit/scripts release:check: FAIL [verification] non-zero-exit\\n17:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-pair.boundary.test.ts > built native API and Website > uses the real API through the binding and browser, including an idle form and no JavaScript\\n38:@taxkit/scripts release:check: web test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-rpc-failures.boundary.test.ts > contains native global, procedure and fatal RPC replies in real Workers\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791339964.455284}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
