rozen graph and tested commit/push/draft delivery.\\nDEV-77 stays In Progress, metrics stay deferred and retained tax results remain\\nunchanged. No external availability or production proof is claimed.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());t=next(t for t in x['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T006');t['browserVerification'].append('Restore checked server form/report/error through a paused first React render and completed hydration with a separate client registry; preserve retained answers and guidance without replay, then prove the next explicit request uses the restored form.');p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());x['outcome']='Corrected saved-state lifetime passed focused and complete native browser checks; first full local graph failed and corrected full graph is pending; T006 remains in progress';x['candidate']['phase']='Corrected browser source b; complete frozen CI-mode graph pending';x['ownership']['runtime']+='; shared page view retained until root registry disposal, with explicit page interruption';x['ownership']['privacy']='In-memory page state only; no browser storage, automatic retries, calculation on read/mount or raw host/cause/input diagnostics';x['receivingQualifications'].append('Unobserved first React rendering can collect seeded state before hydration subscribes; once-only useAtomInitialValues cannot reseed removed nodes. Retain the shared view for its root registry lifetime; page cleanup still interrupts work.');x['qualification']['state']='First graph failed; corrected frozen local nine-check graph pending';x['rootCorrection']={'cause':'Registry cleanup removed the unobserved shared view and its seeded report/message parents during paused initial rendering; later once-only seeds were ignored','priorOracleGap':'Focused fixture reused server/client registry and could read SSR HTML before hydration completed','directOracle':'Separate server/client registries, unobserved first client rendering and idle cleanup, hydration effect and another idle interval; all nine errors failed before correction','correction':'Atom.keepAlive on the shared page view; registry disposal releases in-memory snapshot/client and page cleanup still interrupts calculations/tools','temporaryDiagnostics':'Fixed presence flags and native registry removal observation only; removed before corrected qualification','storedFigures':'No browser storage or new persistent store'}\nfor prefix in ['dev77-browser-fresh-registry-b','dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-h','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-a','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-b','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-native-a']:\n for line in Path(f'/private/tmp/{prefix}-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines():\n  row=json.loads(line)\n  if row['exitCode']!=0 or prefix=='dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-h':continue\n  log=Path(row.pop('log'));row.update(logId=log.name,logSha256=hashlib.sha256(log.read_bytes()).hexdigest());x['focusedChecks'].append(row)\nfor name,correction in [\n('dev77-browser-frozen-release-a-release-graph.log','Complete verification failed on disappearing native saved reports/errors; all 25 frozen sources matched. Corrected the shared page snapshot lifetime and direct oracle; no full success inferred.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-report-diagnostic-a-native-pair.log','Exact failed built artifacts reproduced a disappearing saved error; focused reproduction alone was not full acceptance.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-i-native-pair.log','Temporary fixed presence flags observed removed view/report/message nodes after checked submission restoration. Removed diagnostics and applied the shared view lifetime correction.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-red-a-browser.log','Stronger direct paused-render fixture failed all nine saved errors before the correction; the same oracle then passed.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-a-lint.log','Corrected new fixture key ordering; full lint then passed.')]:\n log=Path('/private/tmp')/name;x['failedAttempts'].append({'logId':name,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(log.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'correction':correction})\nx['failedGraph']={'command':['bun','run','release:check','--','--ci'],'exitCode':1,'durationSeconds':724.76,'failedCheck':'verification','nativeResult':'9 files/13 tests: 2 failed, 11 passed','sourceReadback':{'matched':25,'mismatches':[]},'next':'Corrected candidate requires a fresh complete graph'};x['documentationImpact']['changeRequired'].append('T006 direct saved-hydration verification and current delivery ledger');x['primaryReview']['checked'].append('Diagnosed unobserved-view cleanup; prior false-green oracle strengthened and failed before correction, then focused/browser-native passed; root-registry memory lifetime is explicit');p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\"format\",[\"bun\",\"x\",\"oxfmt\",\"apps/web/README.md\",\"docs/architecture/frontend.md\",\"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\",\"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\",\"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json\"]],[\"docs\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:docs\"]],[\"runbooks\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:runbooks\"]],[\"format-check\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"format:check\"]],[\"unused\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"knip\"]],[\"unused-production\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"knip:production\"]]]' dev77-browser-corrected-preflight-a"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib,re\np=Path('apps/web/README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('The root registry seeds settings only;', 'The root registry seeds settings and the catalogue;');s=s.replace('marked out of date after editing or interruption. No figures are saved.', '''marked out of date after editing or interruption. The shared page snapshot stays\nin memory until the root registry is disposed. This keeps once-restored server\nanswers and errors through a paused first React render and later navigation.\nNo figures are written to browser storage.''',1);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/frontend.md');s=p.read_text().replace('values and execution. Saved submission admission', '''values and execution. The shared page view uses `Atom.keepAlive` for the root\nregistry's lifetime. This retains its checked form/outcome parents when a first\nReact render pauses before subscriptions attach. Once-only initial-value hooks\ncannot restore values that registry cleanup has already removed. Page cleanup\nstill interrupts calculations and browser callbacks; root disposal releases\nin-memory snapshots and the scoped client. No browser storage is added.\nSaved submission admission''',1);s=s.replace('checks server HTML, hydrated fields, retained reports and no replay.', '''checks server HTML, hydrated fields, retained reports and no replay. A focused\nbrowser fixture uses separate server/client registries, deliberately exercises\nan unobserved first render and cleanup, then waits for client mounting and idle\ncleanup before asserting the restored guidance and next explicit request.''',1);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\n\\n### Saved calculator state through a paused first render\\n\\nThe page view stays alive in its root registry. The browser fixture restores a\\ndifferent amount, period and threshold through a separate server registry. It\\nthen renders once into the client registry without subscribing, lets its queued\\ncleanup run, mounts hydration and waits for a React effect and another cleanup\\ninterval. Guidance, displayed form, shared state and the next explicit request\\nmust still agree; no calculation may occur on mount. This is a controlled live\\nrenderer lifetime check, not a network or autonomous agent proof.\\n\\nThe original shared-registry fixture could observe server HTML before hydration\\ncompleted. Complete built-app checks exposed disappearing saved reports/errors.\\nThe stronger fixture failed for all nine saved errors before `Atom.keepAlive`\\nwas applied to the shared view, then passed. The native saved-report/error checks\\nalso wait for document network idle and use bounded locator reads. Actual native\\nHTML, browser fields, retained answers and no replay remain separate oracles.\\nSee the [dated browser receipt](../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json)\\nfor the failed graph, direct reproduction, correction and subsequent evidence.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('| T005 / DEV-76 | In progress | All 61 accepted pages, navigation, search, discovery, both Markdown representations and share images are locally qualified in draft #155. Current release/Quality replacement checks are the next candidate. Old app/build/operation retirement remains unfinished; metrics are deferred. |','| T005 / DEV-76 | Complete locally; draft review outstanding | Documentation reader and old app/build/operation retirement passed the complete local graph and exact #155 hosted Quality. Metrics remain deferred. |',1);s=s.replace('| T006 / DEV-77 | Pending T004/T005 | Remote MCP and page-owned browser tools. |','| T006 / DEV-77 | In progress | Modern remote tools are locally tested in draft #156 with exact-head hosted Quality. Browser tools and saved-state lifetime pass focused/native checks; complete graph and draft delivery remain next. Older sessions, remote cancellation and public setup remain unfinished. |',1);s+='''\\n\\n## 2026-10-07 — Saved page state correction before browser delivery\\n\\nThe first full browser candidate graph failed complete verification: saved\\nreports/errors disappeared after built-page hydration. All twenty-five frozen\\nsources still matched. Private fixed-flag diagnostics confirmed that checked\\nsubmission data reached the browser, then the registry removed the unobserved\\npage view and its seeded parents before React subscribed. The once-only hook\\nthen ignored re-seeding. Those temporary diagnostics are removed.\\n\\nThe original focused test reused a server/client registry and could inspect SSR\\nHTML too early. The stronger direct test uses a separate server, an unobserved\\nfirst client render and cleanup, an actual hydration effect, and another idle\\ninterval. All nine saved errors failed before the correction. Keeping the shared\\npage view alive for the root registry retains its checked form/outcome parents\\nand fixes the loading race without another calculator or browser storage. Page\\ncleanup still cancels work and removes tools; root disposal releases the values\\nand client. This deliberate in-memory lifetime is recorded in the frontend owner.\\n\\nAll twenty-one focused browser tests and thirteen actual built-app cases across\\nnine files now pass, including distinct saved figures, retained reports, safe\\nerrors, manual/browser calls, cancellation and route changes. The first full\\ngraph and direct failures remain in the dated receipt. The corrected candidate\\nstill needs the complete frozen graph and tested commit/push/draft delivery.\\nDEV-77 stays In Progress, metrics stay deferred and retained tax results remain\\nunchanged. No external availability or production proof is claimed.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());t=next(t for t in x['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T006');t['browserVerification'].append('Restore checked server form/report/error through a paused first React render and completed hydration with a separate client registry; preserve retained answers and guidance without replay, then prove the next explicit request uses the restored form.');p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());x['outcome']='Corrected saved-state lifetime passed focused and complete native browser checks; first full local graph failed and corrected full graph is pending; T006 remains in progress';x['candidate']['phase']='Corrected browser source b; complete frozen CI-mode graph pending';x['ownership']['runtime']+='; shared page view retained until root registry disposal, with explicit page interruption';x['ownership']['privacy']='In-memory page state only; no browser storage, automatic retries, calculation on read/mount or raw host/cause/input diagnostics';x['receivingQualifications'].append('Unobserved first React rendering can collect seeded state before hydration subscribes; once-only useAtomInitialValues cannot reseed removed nodes. Retain the shared view for its root registry lifetime; page cleanup still interrupts work.');x['qualification']['state']='First graph failed; corrected frozen local nine-check graph pending';x['rootCorrection']={'cause':'Registry cleanup removed the unobserved shared view and its seeded report/message parents during paused initial rendering; later once-only seeds were ignored','priorOracleGap':'Focused fixture reused server/client registry and could read SSR HTML before hydration completed','directOracle':'Separate server/client registries, unobserved first client rendering and idle cleanup, hydration effect and another idle interval; all nine errors failed before correction','correction':'Atom.keepAlive on the shared page view; registry disposal releases in-memory snapshot/client and page cleanup still interrupts calculations/tools','temporaryDiagnostics':'Fixed presence flags and native registry removal observation only; removed before corrected qualification','storedFigures':'No browser storage or new persistent store'}\nfor prefix in ['dev77-browser-fresh-registry-b','dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-h','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-a','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-b','dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-native-a']:\n for line in Path(f'/private/tmp/{prefix}-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines():\n  row=json.loads(line)\n  if row['exitCode']!=0 or prefix=='dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-h':continue\n  log=Path(row.pop('log'));row.update(logId=log.name,logSha256=hashlib.sha256(log.read_bytes()).hexdigest());x['focusedChecks'].append(row)\nfor name,correction in [\n('dev77-browser-frozen-release-a-release-graph.log','Complete verification failed on disappearing native saved reports/errors; all 25 frozen sources matched. Corrected the shared page snapshot lifetime and direct oracle; no full success inferred.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-report-diagnostic-a-native-pair.log','Exact failed built artifacts reproduced a disappearing saved error; focused reproduction alone was not full acceptance.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-diagnostic-i-native-pair.log','Temporary fixed presence flags observed removed view/report/message nodes after checked submission restoration. Removed diagnostics and applied the shared view lifetime correction.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-red-a-browser.log','Stronger direct paused-render fixture failed all nine saved errors before the correction; the same oracle then passed.'),\n('dev77-browser-saved-lifetime-green-a-lint.log','Corrected new fixture key ordering; full lint then passed.')]:\n log=Path('/private/tmp')/name;x['failedAttempts'].append({'logId':name,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(log.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'correction':correction})\nx['failedGraph']={'command':['bun','run','release:check','--','--ci'],'exitCode':1,'durationSeconds':724.76,'failedCheck':'verification','nativeResult':'9 files/13 tests: 2 failed, 11 passed','sourceReadback':{'matched':25,'mismatches':[]},'next':'Corrected candidate requires a fresh complete graph'};x['documentationImpact']['changeRequired'].append('T006 direct saved-hydration verification and current delivery ledger');x['primaryReview']['checked'].append('Diagnosed unobserved-view cleanup; prior false-green oracle strengthened and failed before correction, then focused/browser-native passed; root-registry memory lifetime is explicit');p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\"format\",[\"bun\",\"x\",\"oxfmt\",\"apps/web/README.md\",\"docs/architecture/frontend.md\",\"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\",\"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\",\"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\",\"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json\"]],[\"docs\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:docs\"]],[\"runbooks\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:runbooks\"]],[\"format-check\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"format:check\"]],[\"unused\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"knip\"]],[\"unused-production\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"knip:production\"]]]' dev77-browser-corrected-preflight-a"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","stdout":"{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"x\", \"oxfmt\", \"apps/web/README.md\", \"docs/architecture/frontend.md\", \"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\", \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\", \"docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\", \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-browser-calculator-tools.json\"], \"exitCode\": 2, \"durationSeconds\": 0.08, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev77-browser-corrected-preflight-a-format.log\"}\nExpected at least one target file. All matched files may have been excluded by ignore rules.\n\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"x\", \"oxfmt\", \"apps/web/README.md\", \"docs/architecture/frontend.md\", \"docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\", \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\", \"docs/product