ters without closing the script. The actual official MCP network client runs against the source-built Worker, with native JSON/SSE parsing rather than handwritten frames. Its report/page decode through canonical Schemas and equal real HTTP replies; alternating transports exhaust the same local limiter. In-process real-client cancellation separately fills all eight places, cancels one, finishes a replacement and closes the others. This does not prove network cancellation or older session routing. Chrome153 actual native developer-tools events and invoke/cancel commands require real registration and native replies rather than a copied host object. A manual response witness must complete before answer equality. Pending real RPC is held at browser transport to prove busy admission, native caller abort, edit cancellation, successful manual retry and removal of five tools on route exit. Restored non-default pay fields, shared view and next checked request must agree. This is a test-controlled native caller, not an autonomous model session.\",\n      \"environment\": \"Local TaxKit checkout, native workerd and Chromium\",\n      \"authority\": \"none\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-website.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-website-failures.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-local-development.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-native-trace-containment.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-stale-calculator-answer.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-take-home-explanation.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-calculator-catalogue-rpc.json\",\n        \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-05-calculator-pages.json\",\n        \"