{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:49:31.300Z","ordinal":59849,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5b325284487d0bdcdc6efcded38ee","status":"completed","call_id":"call_eff6bf377a56444ca676457d53cb01e5","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/web/src/lib/calculator.atoms.ts\\n@@\\n-      // before hydration subscribes. Page cleanup still interrupts live work;\\n-      // The retained view also holds its whole weak-family description group.\\n+      // before hydration subscribes. Page cleanup still interrupts live work.\\n+      // The retained view also holds its whole weak-family description group.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/web/test/native-browser-tools.boundary.test.ts\\n@@\\n       const returnedTools = yield* discover();\\n+      yield* Effect.promise(() =>\\n+        expect\\n+          .poll(() => page.getByLabel(\\\"Annual taxable income\\\").inputValue())\\n+          .toBe(\\\"77000\\\")\\n+      );\\n       const returned = yield* call(returnedTools, \\\"taxkit_read_result\\\");\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/frontend.md\\n@@\\n-calculator's description group is retained by React while mounted because\\n-`Atom.family` uses weak references. The registry owns the group's transient\\n-values and execution. The shared page view uses `Atom.keepAlive` for the root\\n-registry's lifetime. This retains its checked form/outcome parents when a first\\n+calculator's description group is weakly cached by `Atom.family`. The registry\\n+owns its transient values and execution. The shared page view uses\\n+`Atom.keepAlive` for the root registry's lifetime and its read callback holds\\n+the whole immutable description group. Holding only individual members would\\n+let browser memory cleanup remove the group and create a second description\\n+on a return visit, leaving the old values behind. This retains both page\\n+identity and checked form/outcome parents when a first\\n@@\\n cleanup before asserting the restored guidance and next explicit request.\\n+The native caller also leaves the annual page, forces actual browser garbage\\n+collection and returns. Visible fields, the shared result and the retained stale\\n+answer must still agree without another RPC request.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/web/README.md\\n@@\\n-The React page retains its atom-family description while mounted.\\n-Controls have visible keyboard focus and a skip link to the single main landmark. That family\\n-uses weak references; holding only one member does not retain its grouping\\n-object. It describes state and work only, without a cached client or answer.\\n-The registry still owns values and execution.\\n+The root registry retains the shared view, whose read callback holds the whole\\n+atom-family description group. That family uses weak references; holding only\\n+individual members would allow a second group on a return visit after browser\\n+memory cleanup. The group describes state and work, while the registry owns\\n+values and execution. Controls have visible keyboard focus and a skip link to\\n+the single main landmark.\\n@@\\n-answers and errors through a paused first React render and later navigation.\\n+answers and errors through a paused first React render and later navigation,\\n+including browser memory cleanup between leaving and returning.\\n@@\\n-editing, manual retry and route cleanup. It uses local ports 4230/4231. This is\\n+editing, manual retry, route cleanup and a return after forced browser garbage\\n+collection without losing fields/results or starting a request. It uses local\\n+ports 4230/4231. This is\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\\n@@\\n all five registrations and interrupts unfinished execution. Reply observations\\n retain unmatched native events so one reply cannot hide another cancellation.\\n+After leaving, actual Chrome garbage collection runs before the caller returns\\n+to the annual page. Visible fields, the shared form and the previous stale\\n+report must survive without a new RPC request. This failed before the retained\\n+view's callback also held the whole weak-family description group.\\n@@\\n for the failed graph, direct reproduction, correction and subsequent evidence.\\n+\\n+Keeping a value node alone does not keep its weak-family grouping object. The\\n+native return-after-garbage-collection check catches that separate identity\\n+failure: the earlier focused checks left the description reachable while mounted\\n+and never forced browser collection between visits. The retained view now reads\\n+through its immutable group, so registry values and descriptions share a\\n+lifetime. Root disposal still releases the registry and scoped client.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text())\\ndef visit(v):\\n if isinstance(v,dict):\\n  if 'browserVerification' in v:\\n   v['browserVerification'].append('Leave the annual calculator, force actual native browser garbage collection and return; visible fields, shared form and retained stale report must still agree without another RPC request or replacement page description.')\\n  for z in v.values(): visit(z)\\n elif isinstance(v,list):\\n  for z in v: visit(z)\\nvisit(x);p.write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/verification/critical-journeys.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text())\\ndef journey(v):\\n if isinstance(v,dict):\\n  if v.get('id')=='taxkit-native-website':\\n   v['expectedBehavior'].append('Leaving the annual calculator, forcing actual Chrome garbage collection and returning preserves visible fields and the shared retained stale report without another RPC request; the retained view also holds its weak-family description group.')\\n   v['observableOracle']+=' Actual HeapProfiler collection between departure and return must preserve the distinct annual amount and earlier report without a new request; keeping only registry value nodes cannot satisfy this oracle.'\\n  for z in v.values(): journey(z)\\n elif isinstance(v,list):\\n  for z in v: journey(z)\\njourney(x);p.write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:2200}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791341349.1612225}}}
