C after route departure caused returned fields to reset from 77000 to 67000; retain the whole immutable weak-family group through the retained view callback.'),\\n ('dev77-browser-description-green-a-types.log','A mistyped private check command check:types did not run; corrected to the owning check-types command. This is not an application failure.'),\\n ('dev77-browser-description-green-b-lint.log','A callback referencing a later separate constant failed no-use-before-define. Define the immutable group with its view callback in the same initialiser and an owning Schema-derived return type; no rule disabled.')]:\\n  y=ident('/private/tmp/'+name);y['correction']=why;x['failedAttempts'].append(y)\\nx['interruptedGraph']={\\n 'command':['bun','run','release:check','--','--ci'],\\n 'exitCode':130,'reason':'Primary review found the weak-family grouping identity defect; stopped before qualification and added the actual native GC oracle',\\n 'completedStages':['verification','test','build','docs-validation','packed-artifact','downstream-consumer','api-smoke'],\\n 'interruptedStage':'docs-browser','sourceReadback':{'matched':28,'mismatches':[]},\\n 'wrapperLogIdentity':ident('/private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-release-b-release-graph.log'),\\n 'nonClaim':'Seven stages passed, but the interrupted graph is not complete qualification; source c requires a fresh whole graph'}\\nx['rootCorrection']['descriptionCause']='The retained value node held member atoms but not the weak-family returned group; native browser collection allowed a new default group after route return while old registry values remained'\\nx['rootCorrection']['descriptionPriorOracleGap']='Mounted focused fixtures retained the grouping object; no forced native garbage collection occurred between page visits'\\nx['rootCorrection']['descriptionDirectOracle']='Actual Chrome HeapProfiler.collectGarbage after leaving the annual page, return through native navigation, visible input/shared form/previous stale report equality and no new RPC; failed before and passed after correction'\\nx['rootCorrection']['descriptionCorrection']='View callback reads immutable group.form, retaining the same grouping identity for the root registry lifetime without a new cache or mutation'\\nx['primaryReview']['checked'].append('Primary review rejected partial source b after finding a separate weak-family description defect; promoted actual native GC return oracle, observed red then green, retained immutable description identity and root-registry resource disposal')\\nx['primaryReview']['result']='Static contracts, command/state parity, value/description lifetimes, cleanup, privacy and exact-path controls reviewed; corrected source c complete local graph pending'\\nfor r in x['candidate']['sources']:r['sha256']=hashlib.sha256(Path(r['path']).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\\np.write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPath('/private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-sources-c.json').write_text(json.dumps(x['candidate']['sources'],indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPath('/private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-proof-c.json').write_text(json.dumps({'path':str(p),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()},indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\ns=Path('/private/tmp/dev77-close-browser-proof-b.py').read_text().replace('release-b','release-c').replace('sources-b','sources-c').replace('proof-b','proof-c').replace('source b','source c')\\ns=s.replace('root-registry snapshot/page-execution lifetimes','root-registry snapshot/weak-family description/page-execution lifetimes')\\nPath('/private/tmp/dev77-close-browser-proof-c.py').write_text(s)\\nprint(json.dumps({'sources':len(x['candidate']['sources']),'receiptFrozen':True,'phase':'c'}))\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:1500}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\\\"release-graph\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"release:check\\\",\\\"--\\\",\\\"--ci\\\"]]]' dev77-browser-frozen-release-c\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1700}));