{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:54:09.293Z","ordinal":60010,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5b447ac0c87d0b01c0d62cf4ab768","status":"completed","call_id":"call_eL8HU8jNu3B3nEMKWex1iVOX","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('/private/tmp/dev77-older-session-preparation.md')\\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n\\\\nFurther source-only preparation while browser source c remains frozen:\\n- Native RpcServer.makeProtocolWithHttpEffect waits for its first queued reply\\n  chunk before returning a response. McpServer converts a live stream or multiple\\n  native messages into SSE itself. A held operation with no initial native\\n  message therefore need not send response headers before it finishes.\\n- The current TaxKit bounded reply additionally materialises the complete native\\n  body before returning. A positive active-stream platform signal test cannot\\n  qualify that pre-header path. Preserve native framing; do not prepend custom\\n  SSE keepalives or copy native session/JSON parsers to force early headers.\\n- Alchemy beta.80 Workers/HttpServer.ts passes HttpEffect.scopeTransferToStream\\n  into HttpServerResponse.toWeb. Native streamed bodies retain their request\\n  Scope until body exit; the Worker/DO bridge recognises the ejected scope. This\\n  supports scoped streaming as a substrate, not proof of a chosen app change.\\n- Captured service Context is reconstructed per native isolate, not evidence of\\n  a globally shared calculation pool. An older-session DO must not instantiate\\n  independent application rate/work owners and claim transport parity from\\n  capture alone. Real native interleaved API/MCP allowance and work checks are\\n  required before accepting any layout.\\nSources: installed effect/src/rpc/RpcServer.ts:1061-1198;\\nMcpServer.ts:1605-1631; effect/src/http/HttpEffect.ts:215-235;\\nalchemy/src/Cloudflare/Workers/HttpServer.ts:61-88;\\nDurableObjectBridge.ts:149-201. Existing application source was read from parent\\nGit object identity only. No tracked source, provider, public endpoint or\\nresource changed, and no application cancellation/expiry claim is added.\\n''')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"tail -6 /private/tmp/dev77-browser-frozen-release-c-release-graph.log && tail -5 tmp/release-readiness/verification-stdout-4NbH9R/*.log\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791341625.577892}}}
