{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:55:35.932Z","ordinal":60032,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5b4a5372087d094362e22a1bd33db","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ad5a2e885dbe43eba024dc4b36e290cf","name":"exec","input":"const r=await Promise.allSettled([tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_get_issue({id:\"DEV-78\",includeRelations:true}),tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_get_issue({id:\"DEV-79\",includeRelations:true})]); for(let i=0;i<r.length;i++){text({issue:i===0?\"DEV-78\":\"DEV-79\",result:r[i]});}\ntext(ALL_TOOLS.filter(x=>/cloudflare|doppler/i.test(x.name+\" \"+x.description)).map(x=>({name:x.name,description:x.description.slice(0,90)})));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791341733.2177262}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:55:35.986Z","ordinal":60033,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","session_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","root_turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","response_id":"resp_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac5b496d8e087d08788ecb334ccdfac","usage":{"input_tokens":132902,"cached_input_tokens":130560,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":514,"reasoning_output_tokens":375,"total_tokens":133416},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":296086237,"cached_input_tokens":290520576,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1582093,"reasoning_output_tokens":798166,"total_tokens":297668330},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1131472776,"cached_input_tokens":1108359040,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5525073,"reasoning_output_tokens":2477210,"total_tokens":1136997849}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:55:36.968Z","ordinal":60034,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-addbea8d-1df7-441b-9bd1-7f3b65895f6a","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-78","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-78\",\"uuid\":\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\",\"title\":\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T007` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nThe rebuilt apps need correct domains and scoped secrets without disturbing existing DNS or allowing Preview to use Production.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Read the real [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) zone, account, records, registrar and DNSSEC state. Preserve unrelated mail and verification records.\\n* Declare the retained Production zone, [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) website, www redirect and [api.taxkit.dev](<http://api.taxkit.dev>) backend through native Alchemy resources. Preview uses its own addresses and API.\\n* Use native host URL bindings and cross-resource Outputs, checked at app entry. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour.\\n* Select Doppler configs by stage through Stack.secrets, prevent shell overrides, pass only named runtime bindings and separate deploy/runtime/query/Turbo credentials.\\n* Prepare an exact version-matched provider plan and recovery/readback procedures; applying it requires the separate concrete approval.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* The plan names exact accounts/resources/stages and leaves Production DNS untouched for Preview.\\n* Checked bindings and Doppler precedence work without exposing secrets.\\n* DNS, TLS, registrar and deployment checks remain explicit follow-ups to any approved apply; planning is not treated as deployment proof.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run check:docs-deployment:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment-tools:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment`, `bun run test:docs-deployment`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:repository-paths`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L550>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-78-csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:04.412Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"infra\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":27594625}},"started_at_ms":1791341735940,"completed_at_ms":1791341736968}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:55:40.185Z","ordinal":60035,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-17a8d419-0710-4133-bd67-d387bdf47617","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-79","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:09.345Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":4,"nanos":244327666}},"started_at_ms":1791341735940,"completed_at_ms":1791341740185}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T02:55:40.243Z","ordinal":60036,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11449-c0d3-7fa1-900a-67b69c178edb","call_id":"call_ad5a2e885dbe43eba024dc4b36e290cf","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"issue\":\"DEV-78\",\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-78\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T007` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuilt apps need correct domains and scoped secrets without disturbing existing DNS or allowing Preview to use Production.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Read the real [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) zone, account, records, registrar and DNSSEC state. Preserve unrelated mail and verification records.\\\\n* Declare the retained Production zone, [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) website, www redirect and [api.taxkit.dev](<http://api.taxkit.dev>) backend through native Alchemy resources. Preview uses its own addresses and API.\\\\n* Use native host URL bindings and cross-resource Outputs, checked at app entry. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour.\\\\n* Select Doppler configs by stage through Stack.secrets, prevent shell overrides, pass only named runtime bindings and separate deploy/runtime/query/Turbo credentials.\\\\n* Prepare an exact version-matched provider plan and recovery/readback procedures; applying it requires the separate concrete approval.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* The plan names exact accounts/resources/stages and leaves Production DNS untouched for Preview.\\\\n* Checked bindings and Doppler precedence work without exposing secrets.\\\\n* DNS, TLS, registrar and deployment checks remain explicit follow-ups to any approved apply; planning is not treated as deployment proof.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run check:docs-deployment:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment-tools:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment`, `bun run test:docs-deployment`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:repository-paths`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L550>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-78-csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:04.412Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"infra\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-74\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"issue\":\"DEV-79\",\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:09.345Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":null,\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"backlog\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"analytics\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__executor__personal__executor_personal_execute\",\"description\":\"Use this Executor for Cooper's personal accounts: Gmail (coopercorbett@gmail.com); Google \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__executor__personal__executor_personal_resume\",\"description\":\"Use this Executor for Cooper's personal accounts: Gmail (coopercorbett@gmail.com); Google \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__executor__personal__executor_personal_skills\",\"description\":\"Use this Executor for Cooper's personal accounts: Gmail (coopercorbett@gmail.com); Google \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_add_custom_domain\",\"description\":\"Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, po\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_get_site_worker_logs\",\"description\":\"Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, po\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_read_database_overview\",\"description\":\"Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, po\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__sites_read_database_table_rows\",\"description\":\"Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, po\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__executor_personal__execute\",\"description\":\"Execute TypeScript in a sandboxed runtime.\\n\\nBefore writing code, call `skills({ name: \\\"exe\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791341740.243005}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
